  "homeBatteryBody": "Android restricts background activity to save battery. Without an exception, the VPN tunnel may be killed when the screen turns off — your connection drops until you reopen L×Box.\n\nOpen system settings and choose \"Unrestricted\" / \"Not optimized\".",
